role: G5 pri_B (run count per symbol) for the MS-MPEG4 intra-block DCT AC
  TCOEF run/level/last alphabet. Per spec/99 §5.1 / §10.3 this is the second
  half of the G5 G-descriptor; G5 pri_A lives at file 0x57830..0x57896
  (102 bytes) inside region_0569c0. count_A = 102, count_B = 66.
note: extracted as a stand-alone region because it falls in the 408-byte gap
  between region_0569c0's end (0x57898) and region_057a30's start (0x57a30).
  Audit/01 §4.1 enumerates the (run, level) per index for sub-class A and
  sub-class B; the build-time check in build.rs cross-validates the bytes
  against that enumeration before emitting the constant.
